  "title": "wslua: Fix Coverity issues in Lua debugger",
  "description": "Synchronize reads and writes of debugger state, paused_L, and breakpoint\nfields with debugger.mutex so they match other paths that already take\nthe lock.\n\nIn LuaDebuggerDialog, drop redundant null checks on ui (it is always\nset after setupUi) and keep guards only for child widgets such as\ncodeTabWidget and the trees.\n\nCoverity CID 1691611, 1691612, 1691613, 1691614, 1691615\n\nAI-Assisted: yes",
